      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Directional coronary atherectomy of a severe stenosis of the left anterior descending coronary artery was complicated by device fracture between the cylindric housing portion and the distal nose-cone collecting chamber. After successful removal of the DCA device, an early occlusion of the coronary vessel occurred, which could be successfully treated by perfusion balloon catheter."},
